SOM WebCore
Copyright 2026 Frederico Kluser

This product includes documentation, diagrams, and figures derived from two
research reports on single-pass WebGPU/Wasm32 inference for System One Models
(SOM), supplied by the project author. The infographic pages reproduced in
docs/figures/ are attributions to those reports; the consolidated text in
research/ is a local extraction used as project memory.

No third-party source code is bundled in this repository. References to
third-party projects, models, and specifications are provided for
interoperability and attribution; all trademarks and licenses remain with
their respective owners.

