Models
------

Model weights are never bundled in this repository. tools/fetch_model.py
downloads them from the pinned revision listed in models/catalog.json and
verifies every file by SHA-256. Each model keeps its own license:

- TS-Ettin-17M (https://huggingface.co/typestrict/TS-Ettin-17M), revision
  026af312e41d24a1126f8d927bb6314fc2d5f592, by typestrict.ai, licensed under
  the Apache License, Version 2.0. It is derived from
  cross-encoder/ettin-reranker-17m-v1 (Apache-2.0), which is derived from
  jhu-clsp/ettin-encoder-17m (MIT).
